---
import BaseLayout from '~/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SponsorMeter from '~/components/ui/SponsorMeter.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Sponsors"
  description="opentier is funded entirely by sponsorship. $100/month minimum target. No ads, no affiliate links."
  canonical="https://opentier.dev/sponsors"
>
  <section class="container-narrow sponsors-page">
    <header class="page-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Support · transparent ledger</p>
      <h1>Keeping the lights on costs $100/month.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        opentier runs on sponsorship. No ads, no affiliate links, no newsletter wall — sponsors
        cover the domain, the verifier compute, and the hour-a-week of human checking that keeps the
        catalog honest.
      </p>
    </header>

    <SponsorMeter variant="page" />

    <div class="cta-row">
      <a
        class="donate sponsor-primary"
        href="https://github.com/sponsors/Pratiyush"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        target="_blank"
      >
        Sponsor on GitHub →
      </a>
      <a
        class="donate sponsor-secondary"
        href="https://www.buymeacoffee.com/pratiyush"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        target="_blank"
      >
        Buy Me a Coffee
      </a>
    </div>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>i. The ledger</h2>
      <p class="block-lede">
        What $100/month actually covers. We publish this so you can audit the ask, not just trust
        it.
      </p>
      <table class="ledger">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Line item</th>
            <th>Monthly</th>
            <th>Notes</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td>Domain — <code>opentier.dev</code></td>
            <td class="cost">$0</td>
            <td
              >Free via is-a.dev. We will buy a paid <code>.dev</code> at v3.0 (~$1.25/mo amortised).</td
            >
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Hosting — GitHub Pages</td>
            <td class="cost">$0</td>
            <td>Free tier. 100 GB bandwidth/mo soft cap — well below our usage.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Email routing — <code>removals@</code></td>
            <td class="cost">$0</td>
            <td>Cloudflare Email Routing free tier; replaces a $5/mo Fastmail line.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Weekly Playwright verifier</td>
            <td class="cost">$0</td>
            <td>GitHub Actions free minutes. At-risk if usage grows; budget for $25/mo.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Human verification retainer</td>
            <td class="cost">~$60</td>
            <td>1 hr/week, fair rate. Walks the monthly cron's stale-services issue.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Buffer for the unexpected</td>
            <td class="cost">~$15</td>
            <td
              >Domain renewal years, takedown legal review if it ever comes up, abuse-mitigation
              tools.</td
            >
          </tr>
          <tr class="ledger-total">
            <td><strong>Monthly minimum</strong></td>
            <td class="cost"><strong>$100</strong></td>
            <td
              >Honest target. Surplus rolls forward into next month, never into the maintainer's
              pocket.</td
            >
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>ii. Tiers</h2>
      <p class="block-lede">Pick what fits. Each tier sustains a piece of the operation.</p>
      <div class="tier-grid">
        <div class="tier">
          <p class="tier-name">$5 / month</p>
          <p class="tier-perk">Name in the next CHANGELOG.</p>
          <p class="tier-impact">20 supporters at this tier = target hit.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tier">
          <p class="tier-name">$20 / month</p>
          <p class="tier-perk">Link from <code>/sponsors</code> + name in CHANGELOG.</p>
          <p class="tier-impact">5 supporters at this tier = target hit.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tier">
          <p class="tier-name">$50 / month</p>
          <p class="tier-perk">Logo on <code>/sponsors</code> + link + CHANGELOG name.</p>
          <p class="tier-impact">2 supporters at this tier = target hit.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tier tier-top">
          <p class="tier-name">$100 / month</p>
          <p class="tier-perk">
            Sponsor of the month — top of <code>/sponsors</code> page + everything above.
          </p>
          <p class="tier-impact">1 supporter at this tier = target hit, single-handed.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>iii. The honesty clause</h2>
      <p>
        If we don't reach $50/month by <strong>September 2026</strong>, the weekly Playwright
        verifier moves to monthly. If we don't reach $100/month by <strong>December 2026</strong>,
        the human verification retainer pauses and the catalog runs on automation only — which is
        still useful, but worse than the current honest-list bar.
      </p>
      <p>
        If we exceed $100/month, the next $200/month goes to: (a) a paid <code>.dev</code> domain, (b)
        two human verifiers (handles maintainer burnout risk), (c) per-service OG card infrastructure
        that's deferred to v2.1.
      </p>
      <p>
        Past that, surplus rolls into the next year. Nothing flows to the maintainer's pocket.
        Public dashboard at <a href="/sponsors">/sponsors</a> is the only ledger.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>iv. Why no ads</h2>
      <p>
        Affiliate links create an incentive to list services that pay best, not services that are
        best. The cleanest way to avoid that bias is to refuse affiliate money — full stop. See
        <a href="/methodology">methodology</a> for the editorial bar.
      </p>
      <p class="callout">
        <strong>Sponsorship does not influence rankings or listings.</strong> Every service meets the
        same bar: a real free tier you can use today, verified within the last 60 days.
      </p>
    </section>
  </section>

  <style>
    .sponsors-page {
      padding-top: var(--space-xl);
      padding-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
    }
    .page-head {
      margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    }
    .eyebrow {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      color: var(--color-ink-faint);
      margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
    }
    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 var(--space-md);
    }
    .lede {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: var(--color-ink-soft);
      max-width: 60ch;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    }
    .cta-row {
      display: flex;
      gap: var(--space-md);
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin: var(--space-lg) 0;
    }
    .donate {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.75rem 1.3rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 500;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
    .sponsor-primary {
      background: var(--color-ink);
      color: var(--color-paper);
    }
    .sponsor-primary:hover {
      filter: brightness(1.15);
    }
    .sponsor-secondary {
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--color-ink);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
    }
    .sponsor-secondary:hover {
      border-color: var(--color-coral);
      color: var(--color-coral);
    }
    .block {
      padding: var(--space-xl) 0;
      border-top: var(--border-rule);
    }
    .block h2 {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-weight: 400;
    }
    .block-lede {
      color: var(--color-ink-soft);
      margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
    }
    .ledger {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
    .ledger th,
    .ledger td {
      padding: 0.7rem 0.8rem;
      text-align: left;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
      vertical-align: top;
    }
    .ledger th {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      color: var(--color-ink-faint);
    }
    .ledger .cost {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      white-space: nowrap;
      color: var(--color-ink);
    }
    .ledger-total td {
      border-bottom: none;
      border-top: 2px solid var(--color-ink);
      padding-top: 1rem;
    }
    .tier-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: var(--space-md);
    }
    .tier {
      padding: var(--space-md);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      background: var(--color-paper);
    }
    .tier-top {
      background: var(--color-paper-warm);
      border-color: var(--color-coral);
    }
    .tier-name {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      margin: 0 0 0.4rem;
    }
    .tier-perk {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: var(--color-ink-soft);
      margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
    }
    .tier-impact {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--color-ink-faint);
      margin: 0;
    }
    .callout {
      margin-top: var(--space-md);
      padding: var(--space-md);
      background: var(--color-paper-warm);
      border-left: 3px solid var(--color-coral);
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    }
    .callout strong {
      color: var(--color-ink);
    }
    p code,
    td code {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.85em;
      padding: 0.1em 0.3em;
      background: var(--color-paper-warm);
      border-radius: 3px;
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
